# A call stands between the functions behind the birth. The birth takes the run in front of it alone, so that the names keep their order: `size` and what follows are stored where they are written.
# f2 = makeDial
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: = NewObject {{*}}fields=[3, 6, 11, 4, 2, 8, 7, 0, 5, 10, 13]
# CHECK: = PutSlotOrAdd {{*}}key="size"
# CHECK: = PutSlotOrAdd {{*}}key="eleventh"
# CHECK: = PutSlotOrAdd {{*}}key="twelfth"
# RUN(NEVER): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# NEVER-NOT: = PropDefine
